msgid ""
"Expense product of the kilometres beyond the yearly threshold. Its cost is "
"the rate."
msgstr ""
"Produit de dépense des kilomètres au-delà du seuil annuel. Son coût est le "
"taux."

#. module: bf_route_expense
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_route_expense.field_res_company__bf_route_mileage_product_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_route_expense.field_res_config_settings__bf_route_mileage_product_id
